# Sanity CMS — powers /jurnal (blog) and /pers (press releases).
#
# Two files are used, both gitignored:
#   .env              local development (astro dev). Loaded in every mode.
#   .env.production   production build (astro build / npm run deploy).
#                     Overrides .env, so it can point at a different dataset.
#
# Copy this file to each of those and fill in the values from
# https://sanity.io/manage. Until they are set the CMS-backed pages render
# their empty state and the rest of the site works normally.
PUBLIC_SANITY_PROJECT_ID=
PUBLIC_SANITY_DATASET=production

# Add http://localhost:4321 and https://dewataai.com as CORS origins in
# sanity.io/manage (with credentials allowed) so the embedded Studio at /admin
# can authenticate. Opening /admin on an unregistered origin also offers a
# one-click "Add CORS origin" prompt.
